SUMMARY:Saturday Vibes: DJ Ibrahim
DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. Ease into your best summer mood with curated DJ sets spinning feel-good tracks\, setting the perfect tone for sun-soaked hangs. It’s all about great music\, easy energy\, and those spontaneous moments that spark connection and get your day going. \nEnjoy some beats from DJ Ibrahim Khalil!
