SUMMARY:Day Parties: Arab Night
DESCRIPTION:Make Union Summer your first Saturday night stop. Our Day Parties kick things off with a dynamic rotation of live music\, themed weekly to set just the right vibe. From DJ-led dance parties to feel-good live sets\, it’s all about great music\, refreshing drinks\, and a lively crowd ready to move. Start your night where the energy’s already high. \nThis evening’s lineup includes Samer Murad and DJ Ibrahim Michael! \nDJ Ibrahim Michael is a versatile Canadian DJ and event entertainer based in Mississauga\, Ontario. Known for his energetic stage presence and ability to connect with diverse audiences\,\nhe specializes in Arabic\, Middle Eastern\, Mediterranean\, and international music\, blending traditional sounds with modern hits to create unforgettable live experiences. \nSamer Murad is an Arabic singer\, live performer\, and entertainer known for his powerful stage presence and dynamic connection with audiences across the United States and Canada. With a unique blend of Iraqi\, Khaliji\, Egyptian\, Levantine\, and modern Arabic music\, he delivers unforgettable performances for weddings\, concerts\, festivals\, and exclusive events. His live shows combine authentic tarab\, high-energy dance sets\, and audience interaction\, making every event a unique experience.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/day-parties-arab-night/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/MS-Pic.jpeg
GEO:43.6453166;-79.3804073
