SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: Toronto All Star Big Band
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nOne of the most exciting bands around\, the Toronto All-Star Big Band revives the spirit style and sound of the 30’s\, 40’s and 50’s – that golden age of the big bands. Armed with brilliant\nprogramming\, choreography and engaging cultural nostalgia\, this vibrant cast of awesome young talent has earned its position at the top of the list of presenters throughout Ontario and\nin the USA. Theatrical engagements are far reaching\, and recent gigs have included the Glenn Miller festival in Clarinda Iowa\, the Villages and the Snowbird Extravaganza in Florida\, the\nMuskoka Lakes Music Festival\, Beaches International Jazz Festival\, Art Park in Lewiston N.Y. and Toronto’s famed Palais Royale\, Casa Loma and the Old Mill.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/brunch-brass-toronto-all-star-big-band/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/June-14-2026-TABB-photo.jpg
