SUMMARY:The Rudy Ray Show: Woomba Groove
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rich\, evolving world of jazz with the Rudy Ray Show at Union Summer. This captivating series explores jazz across the ages\, weaving together timeless traditions and global influences. Each week\, an eclectic mix of musicians brings boundary-pushing sounds in an immersive musical journey that celebrates the artistry\, history\, and soul of jazz. \nTo begin the series\,Womba Groove is a dynamic Ghanaian musical collective dedicated to preserving\, celebrating\, and sharing the richness of Ghanaian music. Deeply rooted in Ghana’s musical heritage\, the band draws inspiration from the timeless sounds of Palm Wine and Highlife while weaving in contemporary Afrobeat influences to create a sound that feels both authentic and current. All in the purpose to make you groove.This program is in partnership with Rudy Ray.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/rudy-ray-show-mokupe/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/June-14-2026-Womba-Groove-Pic.jpg
