SUMMARY:Monday Blues: The Jay Blues Trio
DESCRIPTION:Ease into your week with two shows of blues music\, showcasing a range of artists. \nThe Jay Blues Trio is a Canadian psychedelic blues and funk band from Toronto composed of Jwoel “Jay” Benn (guitar and vocals)\, Ben Graffam (drums)\, and Kyle Colasanti (bass). Formed in 2023 by a collective of blues\, R&B\, jazz\, and funk musicians performing throughout the local scene\, the band blends Chicago blues\, 70s funk\, and high-energy solos into a groove-driven live experience. \nThe Toronto Blues Society (TBS) is a non-profit charity committed to promoting and preserving the rich legacy of the blues. As the organization celebrates 40 years of championing this vibrant genre\, it continues to honour its roots while inspiring future generations. \nThis program is in partnership with Toronto Blues Society (TBS).
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/monday-blues-the-jay-blues-trio/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/cccc-scaled.jpg
