SUMMARY:TD Music Tuesdays: SEXTÊTE
DESCRIPTION:TD Music Tuesdays at Union Summer brings live performances to the TD Stage with an exciting lineup of emerging and established artists spanning a range of styles and sounds. \nSEXTÊTE is a retro-inspired Motown band and girl-power group based in Toronto\, Canada. This queer and WOC-led ensemble brings audiences back to the 1960s with sweet and soulful arrangements of Motown\, soul\, and retro R&B classics\, complete with rich vocal harmonies and a signature saxophone sound. \nFeaturing seven musicians and three singing frontwomen inspired by classic girl groups of the era\, SEXTÊTE delivers a high-energy performance full of spirit\, soul\, and feel-good nostalgia. \nThis program is presented by TD Music.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/td-music-tuesdays-sextete/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/croped-June-16-2026-SEXTETE-Logo.png
