SUMMARY:Tuesday Tastemaker Series: Pantayo
DESCRIPTION:Tuesday Tastemaker Series at Union Summer brings together music lovers\, industry insiders\, and emerging talent for an elevated midweek experience. In partnership with Polaris Music Prize\, Departure Festival\, and Mirvish Productions\, the patio transforms into a vibrant showcase designed for discovery and connection where tastemakers gather to mix\, mingle\, and experience incredible live music. \nOne Tuesday June 16th – be transported by Pantayo! Pantayo is a Toronto based queer Filipina kulintang band that reimagines traditional kulintang music through contemporary compositions\, weaving together diasporic stories\, ancestral knowledge\, and collective rhthyms \nThis program is in partnership with Polaris Music Prize.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/tuesday-tastemaker-series-union-summer/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Union Summer
