SUMMARY:Soul Sessions: Ladies of Soul led by Quisha Winte
DESCRIPTION:Ease into the weekend with Soul Sessions every Friday night at Union Summer. From smooth R&B and classic Motown to timeless hits across the decades\, our live performers reimagine the songs you love with fresh energy and irresistible groove. It’s a feel-good night of music\, movement\, and nostalgia—guaranteed to get you dancing under the open sky. \nQW Productions\, headlined by Quisha Winte\, brings an electrifying tribute to some of the greatest female artists of all time. Celebrating iconic performers such as Whitney Houston\, Aretha Franklin\, and Beyoncé\, Ladies of Soul delivers powerhouse vocals\, timeless hits\, and an unforgettable live music experience filled with energy\, soul\, and inspiration.
