SUMMARY:Saturday Vibes: Dancehall Fusion (Workshop)
DESCRIPTION:Power up your weekend with Saturday Vibes at Union Summer. Ease into your best summer mood with curated DJ sets spinning feel-good tracks\, setting the perfect tone for sun-soaked hangs. It’s all about great music\, easy energy\, and those spontaneous moments that spark connection and get your day going. \nDancehall Fusion is a high-energy workshop led by Yannick Francis\, blending movement\, rhythm\, and dancehall-inspired styles in an interactive format designed to engage participants and build connection through music and motion.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/saturday-vibes-dancehall-fusion-workshop/
