SUMMARY:Day Parties: Soul Kitchen + Friends Pop-Up
DESCRIPTION:Make Union Summer your first Saturday night stop. Our Day Parties kick things off with a dynamic rotation of live music\, themed weekly to set just the right vibe. From DJ-led dance parties to feel-good live sets\, it’s all about great music\, refreshing drinks\, and a lively crowd ready to move. Start your night where the energy’s already high. \nSoul Kitchen is a live performance project built around high-energy\, groove-driven music designed to keep audiences moving. Blending soulful influences with dynamic live instrumentation\, the group focuses on creating an engaging\, feel-good atmosphere rooted in rhythm and performance. \nStay tuned for additional artist details for this slot.
