SUMMARY:Brunch & Brass: Trash Panda Brass
DESCRIPTION:Soak up the sunshine as lively brass ensembles fill the patio with rich\, feel-good sounds—perfectly paired with a relaxed midday bite. It’s a laid-back\, joyful way to gather\, unwind\, and let the music carry you through your Sunday. \nReturning to Union Summer\, Trash Panda Brass formed in the summer of 2022 on the streets of Toronto with a mission of engaging crowds and spreading queer and inclusive joy. With all arrangements created by members of the band\, they are known for upbeat\, fun-loving performances that pay homage to queer hits and icons. Trash Panda Brass proudly celebrates inclusivity and community through music.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/brunch-brass-trash-panda-brass/
