SUMMARY:Rudy Ray Show: Latin Night – Havana
DESCRIPTION:Step into the rich\, evolving world of jazz with the Rudy Ray Show at Union Summer. This captivating series explores jazz across the ages\, weaving together timeless traditions and global influences. Each week an eclectic mix of musicians brings boundary-pushing sounds — an immersive musical journey that celebrates the artistry\, history\, and soul of jazz. \nLatin Night – Havana is a Cuban-themed performance featuring DLM\, bringing live music\, dancers\, and high-energy crowd interaction. The show delivers a celebratory atmosphere inspired by the vibrant sounds and rhythms of Havana\, designed to engage audiences through movement\, rhythm\, and performance. This program is in partnership with Rudy Ray.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/rudy-ray-show-latin-night-havana/
