SUMMARY:Monday Blues: Crystal Shawanda
DESCRIPTION:Ease into your week with Monday Blues at Union Summer\, featuring two shows of blues music showcasing a range of artists. \nCrystal Shawanda is a powerful vocalist and blues artist known for her soulful delivery and emotionally rich performances. Blending blues with country and roots influences\, she brings a distinctive voice shaped by both technical strength and deep personal expression. \nThe Toronto Blues Society (TBS) is a non-profit charity committed to promoting and preserving the rich legacy of the blues. As the organization celebrates 40 years of championing this vibrant genre\, it continues to honour its roots while inspiring future generations. \nThis program is in partnership with the Toronto Blues Society (TBS).
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/monday-blues-crystal-shawanda/
