DESCRIPTION:Tuesday Tastemaker Series at Union Summer brings together music lovers\, industry insiders\, and emerging talent for an elevated midweek experience. In partnership with Polaris Music Prize\, Departure Festival\, and Mirvish Productions\, the patio transforms into a vibrant showcase designed for discovery and connection where tastemakers gather to mix\, mingle\, and experience incredible live music. \nThis program is in partnership with Departure Festival. \nStay tuned for artist announcement for this slot.
