SUMMARY:Spotlight on Women: Nia Nadurata
DESCRIPTION:Explore a lineup of women in music with a roster of Toronto’s top female talent. \nNia Nadurata has had a performance mindset since childhood and has been developing a soulful blend of indie pop and R&B designed to connect with listeners through vulnerability and emotional honesty. Her music reflects themes of growth\, reflection\, and self-discovery\, capturing both challenging and uplifting moments from coming of age. \nAlongside her solo work\, she has contributed as a songwriter and vocalist with artists including Russ\, Nonso Amadi\, Amaal\, Boslen\, and Isaiah Peck. Her debut EP showcases the depth and maturity of her sound\, drawing influence from artists such as Amy Winehouse\, Aaliyah\, Taylor Swift\, Carole King\, Dijon\, and Billie Eilish. \nThis program is in partnership with City Hall Live\, a City of Toronto program that creates paid opportunities for local bands and provides accessible live music experiences for residents and visitors.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/spotlight-on-women-nia-nadurata/
